     "<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Hope\r\nall going well with you and enjoy the weekend.  </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Check out the new skin on\r\nthe konfound-it app: <a href=\"https://konfound-project.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://konfound-project.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZJkJAYlIKvwrl-ZknWv-h\">https://konfound-project.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Here\r\nare some upcoming workshops and courses.  Perhaps see you at one.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Feb\r\n14: University of Arizona. <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/p4o7z4abik4pr0nmvk7kx/Sensitivity-analysis-course-for-Statistical-horizons-short-course.docx?rlkey=0sru6xolbe1t19f4owpnxiopb&amp;dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/p4o7z4abik4pr0nmvk7kx/Sensitivity-analysis-course-for-Statistical-horizons-short-course.docx?rlkey%3D0sru6xolbe1t19f4owpnxiopb%26dl%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zbPI3hSwX4QPdaTaSoSy_\">Two\r\nKey Techniques for Quantifying the Robustness of Causal Inferences</a>. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Feb\r\n29-March 1: Statistical Horizons. <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/p4o7z4abik4pr0nmvk7kx/Sensitivity-analysis-course-for-Statistical-horizons-short-course.docx?rlkey=0sru6xolbe1t19f4owpnxiopb&amp;dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/p4o7z4abik4pr0nmvk7kx/Sensitivity-analysis-course-for-Statistical-horizons-short-course.docx?rlkey%3D0sru6xolbe1t19f4owpnxiopb%26dl%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zbPI3hSwX4QPdaTaSoSy_\">Two\r\nKey Techniques for Quantifying the Robustness of Causal Inferences</a>.\r\nVirtual. <a href=\"https://statisticalhorizons.com/seminars/two-key-techniques-for-quantifying-the-robustness-of-causal-inferences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://statisticalhorizons.com/seminars/two-key-techniques-for-quantifying-the-robustness-of-causal-inferences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0glsxFeYW_VOtXD1oudoaV\">Register\r\nhere</a>.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">April\r\n11 (3:30 p.m.): MSU Biostats. <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/010knhanm8pfaomuacw0b/modifying-data-for-cox-regression.pptx?rlkey=di9nox6hh2wr84tvan6hhoos3&amp;dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/010knhanm8pfaomuacw0b/modifying-data-for-cox-regression.pptx?rlkey%3Ddi9nox6hh2wr84tvan6hhoos3%26dl%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jQjuKHTnq6jHjkRY5XcdN\">Robustness\r\nof Inference to Replacement &amp; Fragility for Logistic Regression and Hazard\r\nFunctions</a>. <span style=\"color:black\">Room E111 East Fee Hall, MSU. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">April\r\n12: (tentatively).  AERA, Philadelphia. <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/jomy6umtymtl5qqf262a6/aera-workshop-2024.docx?rlkey=m9auszimcsrpq49r4r6sjyv7o&amp;dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/jomy6umtymtl5qqf262a6/aera-workshop-2024.docx?rlkey%3Dm9auszimcsrpq49r4r6sjyv7o%26dl%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Us8NrydiwgII9s5SzZVel\">What\r\nwould it take to Change your Inference? Opening the Discourse about Causal\r\nInferences to a Range of Stakeholders</a>. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">April\r\n17: Chicago. </span><a href=\"https://www.s-r-a.org/2024-annual-meeting-portal\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.s-r-a.org/2024-annual-meeting-portal&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03SDPoOhBEhZZmHJ4cLriZ\">Society\r\nfor Research on Adolescence</a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">. </span><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/egt60rbuzvxm1xqcag43i/What-Would-it-take-to-Change-an-Inference-Frank-society-for-research-on-adolescence.docx?rlkey=7sqn0v3c6oldobitkazc31v9q&amp;dl=0\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/egt60rbuzvxm1xqcag43i/What-Would-it-take-to-Change-an-Inference-Frank-society-for-research-on-adolescence.docx?rlkey%3D7sqn0v3c6oldobitkazc31v9q%26dl%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1P_pxA5mjjaD9Oaf3vYYXB\">What\r\nWould it take to Change an Inference? Quantifying the Robustness of Causal\r\nInferences in Adolescent Research</a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">. </span><a href=\"https://www.s-r-a.org/2024-annual-meeting-pre-conference-program\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.s-r-a.org/2024-annual-meeting-pre-conference-program&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ir8G42S9OdoDbFY245w4a\">Details</a><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">May\r\n23: University of Gothenburg, Sweden. Robustness of Inference to Replacement\r\n&amp; Fragility for Logistic Regression and Hazard Functions. <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/010knhanm8pfaomuacw0b/modifying-data-for-cox-regression.pptx?rlkey=di9nox6hh2wr84tvan6hhoos3&amp;dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/010knhanm8pfaomuacw0b/modifying-data-for-cox-regression.pptx?rlkey%3Ddi9nox6hh2wr84tvan6hhoos3%26dl%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244445654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jQjuKHTnq6jHjkRY5XcdN\">Background\r\nhere</a>.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br clear=\"all\" style=\"break-before:page\">\r\n</span>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ken</span></p>"
